  "canonical_source": "wrl 0.1\ntier G1\ndt_max 1e0\nstimulus_unit 1\nstate s0 : 1 = 0e0\nstate s1 : 1 = 0e0\nstate s2 : 1 = 0e0\nstate s3 : 1 = 0e0\nstate s4 : 1 = 0e0\nstate s5 : 1 = 0e0\nstate s6 : 1 = 0e0\nstate s7 : 1 = 0e0\nparam p0 : s = 1e0 fixed\nlet n0 = state(s0)\nlet n1 = stimulus()\nlet n2 = 5e-1[1]\nlet n3 = threshold(n1, n2)\nlet n4 = param(p0)\nlet n5 = euler_leak(n0, n3, n4)\nlet n6 = state(s1)\nlet n7 = 0e0[1]\nlet n8 = threshold(n1, n7)\nlet n9 = neg(n1)\nlet n10 = select(n8, n1, n9)\nlet n11 = euler_leak(n6, n10, n4)\nlet n12 = state(s2)\nlet n13 = -1e0[1]\nlet n14 = 1e0[1]\nlet n15 = clamp(n1, n13, n14)\nlet n16 = euler_leak(n12, n15, n4)\nlet n17 = state(s3)\nlet n18 = min(n2, n1)\nlet n19 = euler_leak(n17, n18, n4)\nlet n20 = state(s4)\nlet n21 = -5e-1[1]\nlet n22 = max(n21, n1)\nlet n23 = euler_leak(n20, n22, n4)\nlet n24 = state(s5)\nlet n25 = abs(n1)\nlet n26 = euler_leak(n24, n25, n4)\nlet n27 = state(s6)\nlet n28 = relu(n1)\nlet n29 = euler_leak(n27, n28, n4)\nlet n30 = state(s7)\nlet n31 = add(n20, n17, n24, n0, n6, n27, n12)\nlet n32 = euler_leak(n30, n31, n4)\nnext s0 = n5\nnext s1 = n11\nnext s2 = n16\nnext s3 = n19\nnext s4 = n23\nnext s5 = n26\nnext s6 = n29\nnext s7 = n32\nobserve identity_v1(s7)\n"
